{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/0b1abe7267866f73fff7f669228da283.poster.avif?t=1768517578\" width=308 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/0b1abe7267866f73fff7f669228da283.webm?t=1768517578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/0b1abe7267866f73fff7f669228da283.mp4?t=1768517578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping PC-VR-horror adventure that takes you on a dangerous journey through a cursed mansion. As Sydney, an archaeologist searching for her missing brother, you must uncover dark secrets, survive deadly traps, and face terrifying enemies. With a mix of compelling story, challenging puzzles, and intense action, the game offers an experience that will push you to the edge of your nerves.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Atmosphere:</strong> Explore a mansion full of dark secrets and menacing environments.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/15b76bae8573baf7c31be1fc18885f3f.poster.avif?t=1768517578\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/15b76bae8573baf7c31be1fc18885f3f.webm?t=1768517578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/15b76bae8573baf7c31be1fc18885f3f.mp4?t=1768517578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Survival:</strong> Solve tricky puzzles and survive dangerous traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/9cfcf32ce4db907f6ba52ab30a005e01.poster.avif?t=1768517578\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/9cfcf32ce4db907f6ba52ab30a005e01.webm?t=1768517578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/extras/9cfcf32ce4db907f6ba52ab30a005e01.mp4?t=1768517578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compelling Story:</strong> An emotional story that ties your past to your brother\u2019s fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PC-VR:</strong> Experience the horror in VR and immerse yourself deeply in the gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the mansion's secret or be lost in the darkness?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459470?t=1768517578","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459470?t=1768517578","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/b379e5280f2184344bc3023b672352f0a9b1a200/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768517578","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459470/b379e5280f2184344bc3023b672352f0a9b1a200/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768517578","categories":[{"description":"Single-player",